From: Emmanuel <emole@bearilly.local>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:28:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add multi-school support: browse page, dynamic payment,
 schools table

- New schools table with per-school price/features (migration_add_schools.sql)
- New /browse page for selecting a school after registration
- Payment page now reads price/features dynamically instead of hardcoded values
- Payment verify route checks real school price and saves school_id to profile
- Register flow now redirects to /browse instead of straight to /payment
